 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
 - A task ID that does not belong to the project in the path → 404.
+- Freezing (`POST /projects/{pid}/freeze`) is a manager-only write (other roles → 403; archived → 409). It sets every member of the project to `viewer`, managers included, and clears the assignee of every task in the project, since an assignee must be a contributor or manager. Once frozen, no one can change the project's tasks: all task writes are 403. Freezing is one-way: a frozen project has no manager left, so a second freeze is 403.
 
